    <string name="module_intro_portrait_body">It\'s time to look at yourself gently, face on. Your innate qualities, your natural resources, the deep balances of your personality: an intimate snapshot to better understand yourself.</string>
    <string name="module_intro_predictive_title">Your Predictions</string>
    <string name="module_intro_predictive_body">What if you took a look at what\'s ahead? The big trends and cycles shaping your path in the months to come, to face tomorrow with a little more clarity and peace of mind.</string>
    <string name="module_intro_identity_title">Your Identity</string>
    <string name="module_intro_identity_body">There are several sides to you: the one you show the world, the one that secretly drives you, the one you inherited from your own. This module brings them all together, so you can feel more whole.</string>
    <string name="module_intro_human_design_title">Your Human Design</string>
    <string name="module_intro_human_design_body">Imagine an imprint, unique to you, made of energy rather than lines on skin. Your Type, your Strategy and your Authority are its main features — a secret, tailor-made instruction manual to move forward without forcing anything.</string>
    <string name="module_intro_hd_predictions_title">Your Human Design Predictions</string>
    <string name="module_intro_hd_predictions_body">Every day, every month, every major period of your life carries its own energy. Come discover the one accompanying you right now, to better welcome each stage.</string>

    <string name="module_intro_biorhythm_title">Your Biorhythms</string>
    <string name="module_intro_biorhythm_body">Since your birth, three cycles have been looping alongside you: physical, emotional and intellectual. Like waves, they rise and fall at their own pace — noticing them helps you choose the right moment to act, feel or think.</string>

    <string name="module_intro_mirror_soul_title">Mirror of the Soul</string>
    <string name="module_intro_mirror_soul_body">Every day, a question appears before you, chosen according to your life path. Take a moment to welcome it, answer it honestly, and see what it reveals about you today.</string>

